Z||000002||88formula||01-30-2000||10:30 AM||||OUCH that hurts, I’m sorry to here what happened to you and your Fiero. I hope that it can be repaired. You should sue the pants off that guy in the explorer and recoup what you lost and then some. Sounds like that Guy ran the stop sign on purpose. If anyone hit my baby, I might not be stable enough to act sane. ||||reg||1
