Z||000004||RickPierce||01-30-2000||03:25 PM||||I'm in El Cerrito, CA - technically Richmond but only three houses worth.  Yea I'll definitely go after the insurance - but am worried they'll try to total it (Ok you give me a perfect 88 Formula 5 speed and I'll accept - :-).<P>Thanks for all the good words - the guy just blew it, I feel really sorry for the injured though.||||reg||1
