Z||000006||Raydar||01-30-2000||05:31 PM||||Rick...  Glad you're okay. Sorry to hear about the crash. I was going to comment about SUVs and attitudes, but it would all be stereotyping, anyway. Who knows what was going through (or NOT going through) the mind of that driver, anyway. Glad you didn't get hurt any worse.||||reg||1
